cation policy, teacher training and support, and resource allocation, which can effectively enhance the application of generative AI technology in education, and thus have a positive impact on instructional design content creation. School support requires teachers to actively encourage pre-service teachers to be innovative, show initiative, build self-efficacy, and apply generative AI technology in learning.",
