        "text": "[14] studies the many applications of LLMs, including education. LLMs present opportunities for personalized learning materials, improved productivity, and increased accessibility. [24] developed an LLM-based student-facing assistant in the discussion forum and tested the performance in upper-division data science courses, suggesting the practicality of deploying LLMs as tutoring and questionanswering assistants. [29] present an extensive literature review of the usage of LLMs in education, specifically in the computing domain, as an AI assistant for teaching coding [30], answering questions on the course discussion boards [17], providing feedback for programming assignments [11,27], and more. The advancements in Large Language Models (LLMs) within high-school physics education are highlighted in the research \"Revolutionizing High School Physics Education: A Novel Dataset\" [3]. This study showcases the creation of a specialized dataset from NCERT exemplar solutions, expanding from 766 to 7,983 physics questions. The primarily textbased dataset, formatted in JSON, demonstrates LLMs' potential in handling complex educational content, as evidenced by significant METEOR and BERTScore F1 metrics. This development is pivotal in LLM applications for high-school education, enriching the scope of multimodal learning environments. [33] reported the limitations of ChatGPT in mathematical education tasks like question generation, suggesting a need for further improvement in domain adaptation and contextual understanding of LLMs.",
